# Automat environments (maintainer LAN)

Authoritative hosts for the Automat Unraid deployment. Full human runbook:
[docs/ops/AUTOMAT.md](../../docs/ops/AUTOMAT.md).

## Source of truth (version / health / admin UI)

| Role | URL | Notes |
|------|-----|--------|
| **Prod** | `http://10.10.1.202:8788` | Authoritative for version, health, and admin UI checks |
| **smartmap** | `http://10.10.1.202:8790` | Household service. **Never stop it** for Projectionist QA. |
| **QA sidecar** | `http://10.10.1.202:8792` | Ephemeral maintainer QA; Path B Hub pull, not host build. **Never bind `:8790`.** |
| **Not truth** | `https://projectionist.automat.vip` (or ad-hoc SSH tunnels) | CDN/proxy lag; agents wrongly read stale versions here |

- Local `localhost:8788` is often an **SSH tunnel to prod** — not local dev; never use for e2e (see [e2e-port-8788.mdc](e2e-port-8788.mdc)).
- Appdata / rollout kit: `/mnt/user/appdata/projectionist` (Unraid); often mounted as `/Volumes/appdata/projectionist`.
- Rollout: `cd /mnt/user/appdata/projectionist && ./rollout.sh X.Y.Z` (Hub **pull-only** — not a host build) — keep `rollout.sh` synced from `scripts/unraid-rollout.sh`.

## UI verification

When the user reports UI missing/broken — **especially with a screenshot** — verify with **cursor-ide-browser** against the correct LAN host above. Do **not** argue from bundle string greps or “you didn’t scroll.” Trust scrolled-to-bottom + screenshot reports.

Interactive UI QA campaigns: [interactive-ui-qa skill](../skills/interactive-ui-qa/SKILL.md) → target **QA `:8792`**, never prod `:8788`, never smartmap `:8790`. Adversarial UI proofs: [ui-testing-architecture.mdc](ui-testing-architecture.mdc).

## Ops UI (post-1.32.2)

Weekly newsletter + Year in Review admin: **Admin → Ops → Newsletters** (`/admin/newsletters`). Mail = SMTP/Resend/Apprise transport only. See runbook for the historical Mail sticky-bar / iPad Safari footgun and YIR year defaults.

## Release lifecycle

Follow [release.mdc](release.mdc) / [docs/RELEASE.md](../../docs/RELEASE.md) (**Hub-first**). CA proof = pull Hub tag onto QA **`:8792`** (Path B), not Path A host `docker build`. After Hub publish, spin down QA unless a campaign is active. **Never** stop prod `projectionist` / `:8788`. **Never** stop smartmap / `:8790` to free a port.
